## Key Concepts

- CAPA data model with evidence, lineage, owners
- Region-aware lifecycle with detect, contain, remediate, verify and SLAs
- Practical API design for CAPA management
- Metrics to prove containment (MTTR, false positives) and recurrence
- RCA templates and canary rollout plans for changes in observability pipelines

